  "body": "apparently document.open should unregister event listeners \"Unregister all event listeners registered on the Document node and its descendants.\" but shadow DOM isn't really \"descendant\".\r\n\r\nThough, it is unclear to me why we need to unregistered listeners in descendants when we anyhow remove all the old nodes from document.\r\n\r\nWhat should happen here?",
